 "subject": "set color palette for session",
 "messages_listed": 4,
 "last_activity": "2019-03-05T21:33:55Z",
 "messages": [
  {
   "id": "yF0jYLgDAgAJ",
   "from": "jmle...@ucdavis.edu",
   "author": "bd99a39ceafe69fd",
   "date": "2019-03-04T17:11:58Z",
   "subject": "set color palette for session",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello!<div><br></div><div>I understand how to customize colors in a variety of ways in ggplot, but is there a way to set a palette for a session? </div><div><br></div><div>I am looking for something easy that could be added to the beginning of a script instead of building a color vector, using scale_fill_manual(), etc.</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you!</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "YWMJuWFzBAAJ",
   "from": "John Mola",
   "author": "f076e4dbb74e6412",
   "date": "2019-03-04T18:52:24Z",
   "subject": "Re: [D-RUG]: set color palette for session",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I guess it depends on how complex of a solution you need? I recently started just definining colors at the beginning of my markdown scripts by just creating a vector of the colors I want. So just something like:<div><br></div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">colors_i_want &lt;- c(&quot;red&quot;, &quot;blue&quot;, &quot;green&quot;, &quot;orange&quot;) </font></div><div><br></div><div>then later on I just add</div><div><br></div><div><font face=\"monospace, monospace\">scale_fill_manual(values = colors_i_want)</font></div><div><br></div><div><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Someone will likely give you a more sophisticated answer but </font><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">if that&#39;s all you need I see no reason to make it more complicated. If you know you&#39;re using scale_fill_manual over and over, you could even save that into the object :)</span></div><div></div><span><img alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/proxy/qfjyL3TDosfXClg428SIPQWPjhYCru_2Tr0L6AG2iiD2OjOeGhbscbtPRaJSATK_5dsEhFg8PV1gV0tSYMDk2Cw1BpZ_uAHBtJZzi2RUy11ctn_W0aJq4R3UjJuZJ6KiWDNGxAMZqfWxYIW6N5UiovPEhApbvlsW9r3W-NEqf1AX9B-KHcbH4in3VNdKzaunnYWFKHa8yw5pqmXLMZdHohVgbGCiPdna6UR4hYaR=s0-d-e1-ft#https://gml.email/v3.2/t/image/MTU1MTcyNTM2MjUyNjY0MzcyNTIxN2ExNmZkNjRhNTQzNzJhOTRhNWZhJmpvaG5tbW9sYUBnbWFpbC5jb20mZGF2aXMtcnVnQGdvb2dsZWdyb3Vwcy5jb20.gif\"></span></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
    [
