  {
   "id": "0zBXQdF0BAAJ",
   "from": "Matthieu Stigler",
   "author": "f14d4c9d01f43388",
   "date": "2019-03-04T19:18:42Z",
   "subject": "Re: [D-RUG]: set color palette for session",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi</div><div><br></div><div>It does not seem that there is indeed a simple and clean solution. Building on John, one solution is to redefine scale_colour_discrete based on your choice. Note you need to redefine it for each scale you are likely to use (fill, colour, in discrete and continuous versions)</div><div><br></div><div><div><pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important;display:block;overflow-x:auto;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:rgb(248,248,248) none repeat scroll 0% 0%\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">library</span>(ggplot2)\r\nqplot(data=iris, Petal.Length, Petal.Width, color=Species, size=I(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">4</span>))\r\n</code></pre>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\"><img src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/FXlvU2W_iFxLMgtSWtEq-iCd7mXF_A10Uk63nJNT2OF2cQkv57eTSMF_0wSJzHcd-ZE=s0-d-e1-ft#https://i.imgur.com/VjSI1uk.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important;display:block;overflow-x:auto;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:rgb(248,248,248) none repeat scroll 0% 0%\">\r\ncolors_i_want &lt;- c(<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;yellow&quot;</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;pink&quot;</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;green&quot;</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;orange&quot;</span>)\r\nscale_colour_discrete &lt;- <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">function</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">...</span>) scale_colour_manual(<span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">...</span>, values = colors_i_want)\r\nscale_fill_discrete &lt;- <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">function</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">...</span>) scale_fill_manual(<span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">...</span>, values = colors_i_want)\r\n\r\nlast_plot()\r\n</code></pre>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\"><img src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/bF4_HefD6QkObf_y1_pK7vrBeJpzmfFwU6NcXIaL-v_DvnU3NT6FQMqOh2A3azTtkkA=s0-d-e1-ft#https://i.imgur.com/9qAsfl2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:YGBgIHI8YnI+bGlicmFyeShnZ3Bsb3QyKTxicj5xcGxvdChkYXRhPWlyaXMsIFBldGFsLkxlbmd0\r\naCwgUGV0YWwuV2lkdGgsIGNvbG9yPVNwZWNpZXMsIHNpemU9SSg0KSk8YnI+YGBgPGJyPjxicj4h\r\nW10oaHR0cHM6Ly9pLmltZ3VyLmNvbS9WalNJMXVrLnBuZyk8YnI+PGJyPmBgYCByPGJyPjxicj48\r\nYnI+Y29sb3JzX2lfd2FudCAmbHQ7LSBjKCJ5ZWxsb3ciLCAicGluayIsICJncmVlbiIsICJvcmFu\r\nZ2UiKTxicj5zY2FsZV9jb2xvdXJfZGlzY3JldGUgJmx0Oy0gZnVuY3Rpb24oLi4uKSBzY2FsZV9j\r\nb2xvdXJfbWFudWFsKC4uLiwgdmFsdWVzID0gY29sb3JzX2lfd2FudCk8YnI+c2NhbGVfZmlsbF9k\r\naXNjcmV0ZSAmbHQ7LSBmdW5jdGlvbiguLi4pIHNjYWxlX2ZpbGxfbWFudWFsKC4uLiwgdmFsdWVz\r\nID0gY29sb3JzX2lfd2FudCk8YnI+PGJyPmxhc3RfcGxvdCgpPGJyPmBgYDxicj48YnI+IVtdKGh0\r\ndHBzOi8vaS5pbWd1ci5jb20vOXFBc2ZsMi5wbmcp\" style=\"min-height:0;width:0;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:0em;padding:0;margin:0\"></div>